{"id":"a3-u03","level":"a3","order":3,"title":{"en":"Literature","fr":"La littérature","es":"La literatura","ar":"الأدب"},"tip":{"en":"To talk about a text, separate what it says from how it says it: the plot and theme on one side, the style, imagery and tone on the other. Then give your own interpretation.","fr":"Pour parler d'un texte, distinguez ce qu'il dit de la manière dont il le dit : l'intrigue et le thème d'un côté, le style, les images et le ton de l'autre. Proposez ensuite votre interprétation.","es":"Para hablar de un texto, separa lo que dice de cómo lo dice: la trama y el tema por un lado, el estilo, las imágenes y el tono por otro. Después ofrece tu propia interpretación.","ar":"للحديث عن نص ما، افصل بين ما يقوله وطريقة قوله: الحبكة والفكرة المحورية من جهة، والأسلوب والصور والنبرة من جهة أخرى. ثم قدم تأويلك الخاص."},"words":48,"lessons":[{"id":"a3-u03-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"novel, short story, poem","fr":"roman, nouvelle, poème","es":"novela, cuento, poema","ar":"رواية، قصة قصيرة، قصيدة"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u03-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"rhyme, rhythm, author","fr":"rime, rythme, auteur","es":"rima, ritmo, autor","ar":"قافية، إيقاع، مؤلف"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u03-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"protagonist, character, plot","fr":"protagoniste, personnage, intrigue","es":"protagonista, personaje, trama","ar":"بطل، شخصية، حبكة"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u03-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"symbol, imagery, style","fr":"symbole, images poétiques, style","es":"símbolo, imaginería poética, estilo","ar":"رمز، صور شعرية، أسلوب"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u03-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"extract, quotation, interpretation","fr":"extrait, citation, interprétation","es":"fragmento, cita, interpretación","ar":"مقتطف، اقتباس، تأويل"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u03-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"masterpiece, classic, manuscript","fr":"chef-d'œuvre, classique, manuscrit","es":"obra ma